  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Church National Advocacy Campaigns</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Goal
To promote social cohesion, justice, and sustainable development in Zimbabwe by addressing the socio-economic crisis, promoting human dignity, and supporting the achievement of sustainable development.

Objectives
1. To promote social cohesion by addressing the root causes of social unrest, promoting interfaith dialogue, and supporting marginalized groups.
2. To strengthen the rule of law by promoting the alignment of laws with the constitution, supporting the independence of the judiciary, and advocating for human rights.
3. To promote economic empowerment by supporting economic development initiatives, advocating for policies that promote equitable development, and supporting entrepreneurship and job creation.
4. To protect the environment by promoting sustainable environmental practices, supporting conservation efforts, and advocating for environmental justice.</narrative>
  </description>
